NOTE: 

streamfunction1 is for open_boundary1, open_boundary2

The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

open_boundary1

 2D Stokes problem with an open boundary condition.
 pressure imposed in a single point at the obc
 
open_boundary2

 2D Stokes problem with an open boundary condition.
 zero integral pressure imposed on the obc

open_boundary3

 3D Stokes problem with an open boundary condition. 
 zero integral pressure imposed on the obc
